BBS
Links

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.530
That ain't many.

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:15.240
<b>How to 
Make a Website 
From Scratch</b>

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.600
We have a home page now,

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.240
but if people aren't comin'...

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.000
We should make it more flashy.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.990
Nah, that would make it harder to look at.

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:30.000
<b>Banana 
Gifts</b>

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.470
Is that a student in the next bed over?

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:26.400
Oh, because they're talking 
about home pages?

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:28.350
Yeah, they're in high school.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:29.510
Oh?

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.990
To my eyes, that youthful 
determination is blindingly bright.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.170
Is that how it is?

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:37.530
That's how it is.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.690
What? That's not beginner stuff!

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:43.550
No, really. Read it yourself and see!

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:44.330
Youth, huh?

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Poco's Udon World</b>

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:18.150
Episode 6: "Tokyo Tower"

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.360
You woke up?

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:58.180
<i>This is my first time looking 
out at Tokyo in two weeks...</i>

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:01.100
Souta-san! We're in big trouble!

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:02.630
We're right up against the deadline!

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:05.120
Please come back!

