<b>Udon Prefecture 
Vice Governor</b>

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:45.530
A Japanese garden designated as a 
national Special Place of Scenic Beauty.

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:48.560
Once you see it, this park leaves such a 
deep impression that you'll never forget it.

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:50.160
Next time: "Ritsurin Garden."
